      "form_guide": "",
      "comment": "BURNSIDE BOOKIE (8) was sent out long odds last time but charged out of the boxes with a fast early sectional and gave a sight before being swallowed up late, finishing a 4 length fifth (28.01) over 484m at Casino. Key runner on his best form. MISS POLLYWOOD (7) has been in super consistent form recently with two minors on end before missing the frame latest finishing sixth (25.71) at this track. Form from her last run is proving to be solid. Deserves plenty of respect. BLUE MILK (4) finds it hard to win but looks close to breaking through. Has been in the money the last three starts, the latest when third (27.97) at Casino. Solid record here winning three races. Although beaten ran one of the quickest times on the card last start. Likely to be in the finish again. CORNERSTONE (2) should be thereabouts despite an unplaced run here most recently.",
